{"version":1,"key":"card:567","content":{"id":567,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"CSRF（Cross-site request forgery）的意思是"},{"type":"formatted","text":"跨站请求","bold":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"伪造，它利用已登录用户的信息，通过钓鱼网站向已登录的网站发送用户不知道的未授权操作，比如转账操作。常见的手段如在钓鱼网站中搞一个表单，因为用户主动点击提交表单请求会自动携带 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Cookie","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，当用户点击时，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"Cookie","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 就携带过去了，这个操作在服务端就会被认为是合法的，但对于用户来说可能是非法的。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如何预防："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Cookie","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"SameSite","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 设置"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Strict","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：仅对同一站点发送的请求才携带 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Cookie","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，即请求来自于设置的站点"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但如果是从别的页面点击链接导航到当前页面，虽然是同站点，但是这种情况下也不会携带 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Cookie","code":true}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"比如在邮件中点击导航到产品页面，即使之前在产品页面登录过，但是由于这种情况没有携带 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Cookie","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，因此还需要登录，导致体验不佳"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Lax","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"："},{"type":"formatted","text":"SameSite","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性未被设置时的默认行为（规范建议，但是实际上并没有很好的落地，因为需要后向兼容，保证网站能正常工作，禁止第三方 Cookie 的发送对广告影响很大）"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"GET、HEAD","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这些安全请求以及简单请求（"},{"type":"formatted","text":"<form>","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 点击提交）允许携带 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Cookie","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，但必须是用户主动触发的"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"点击 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"a","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 链接跳转"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"点击表单提交（仅 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"GET","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 请求表单提交"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"输入 URL 地址直接访问"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果非用户主动操作，如通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"window.open","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"iframe","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"form.submit","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 等脚本触发的，则是不会携带 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Cookie","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"None","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：不论什么情况下都会携带 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Cookie","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，但必须设置 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Secure","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" （HTTPS）"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"CSRF token"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"服务端生成一个一次性的、短期有效的、唯一的 token 标识下发给客户端，比如做到表单的一个隐藏项，用户看不到，但是提交表单时会携带该 token"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"服务端收到请求后检查 token，如果是服务下发给这个用户的 token，那么认为是合法的"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"由于攻击者无法创建随机且唯一的 token，那么请求认证就不会通过"}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"跨站 vs 跨域","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"text":"对于跨站和跨域，是否携带 Cookie 以及控制有两套不同的机制：","type":"formatted"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"跨域：协议、域名和端口任一不同"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"跨站：有效顶级域名不同（eTLD + 1）就认为是跨站了，"},{"type":"link","url":"https://publicsuffix.org/","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"公共后缀列表"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"定义了哪些网页属于同一网站，如 .com、.github.io、.co 等"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"a.taobao.com、b.taobao.com 同站"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"a.github.io、b.github.io 跨站"}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"跨站肯定跨域，但是跨域不一定跨站。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"以 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"fetch","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 请求为例："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"fetch"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 跨域情况下默认不携带 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Cookie，","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"需要设置 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"credentials: \"include\"","code":true},{"text":"，并且服务端要设置跨域响应头","type":"formatted"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Access-Control-Allow-Credentials: true","code":true}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Access-Control-Allow-Origin","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 不能使用通配符 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"*","code":true}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"跨站情况下，在设置 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"SameSite","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Strict","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Lax","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时不会携带 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Cookie","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，设置为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"None","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时，才会携带 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Cookie","code":true}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"text":"对于是否携带 ","type":"formatted"},{"type":"formatted","text":"Cookie","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 要综合跨站和跨域综合考虑，但是对于攻击者来说，可能不太关注是否跨域请求的返回结果，只要请求能发出去，并且携带了 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Cookie","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 就行。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"link","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Reference/Headers/Set-Cookie","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Set-Cookie"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"link","url":"https://www.ruanyifeng.com/blog/2019/09/cookie-samesite.html","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Cookie 的 SameSite 属性"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"link","url":"https://web.dev/articles/samesite-cookies-explained","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"SameSite cookies explained"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]}]}]}],"tags":["安全/CSRF","面试题"],"createTime":1744697267154,"updateTime":1752402093667,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1752402093667}}